      "ncaCorrectiveAction": "National competent authorities should ensure aircraft operators having their principal place of business in their territory do not conduct operations in FIR Minsk (UMMV), unless use of that airspace is deemed necessary to ensure safe operation in case of unforeseen circumstances.",
